#. 苗木君…！
msgctxt "0001 | CELES"
msgid "Makoto...!"
msgstr ""

#. …何をボサッとしているんだ。
#. さっさと<CLT 3>美術室<CLT>に行くぞ。
msgctxt "0002 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Why are you just standing there? We need to get to the\n"
"<CLT 3>repository<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. え？　じゃあ…！！
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? You mean...!?"
msgstr ""

#. …見つけましたわ。
msgctxt "0004 | CELES"
msgid "...I found them."
msgstr ""

#. 山田君と石丸君の死体は、
#. 美術室に隠してありました。
msgctxt "0005 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Hifumi and Taka's bodies had both been hidden in the\n"
"repository."
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈と大神もすでに呼んである。
#. 俺達は先に行っているぞ…
msgctxt "0006 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I've already told Hina and Sakura. We'll go on\n"
"ahead..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>美術室…そこに２人の死体が…！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Their bodies were in the repository...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まずは…この階を捜索してみよう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better look around this floor first...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>美術室へ急ごう！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to hurry up to the repository!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>美術室へ急ごう！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to hurry up to the repository!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>美術室へ急ごう！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to hurry up to the repository!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>美術室へ急ごう！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to hurry up to the repository!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>美術室へ急ごう！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to hurry up to the repository!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>上り階段があるけど…
#. シャッターが降りてる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are stairs leading up...but the gate's blocking\n"
"my way.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
